#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:1
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allmeen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:2
msgid "Generic restrictions"
msgstr "Allgemeen Ingrenzen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:3
msgid "Disable Window Manager context menu (Alt-F3)"
msgstr "Finsterpleger-Rechtsklickmenü utmaken (Alt+F3)"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:4
msgid "The Window Manager context menu is normally shown when Alt-F3 is pressed or when the menu button on the window frame is pressed."
msgstr "Den Finsterpleger sien Rechtsklickmenü warrt normalerwies wiest, wenn Du Alt+F3 drückst oder op den Finsterrahmen sien Menüknoop klickst."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:5 kiosk_data.cpp:173
msgid "Disable Bookmarks"
msgstr "Leestekens utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:6
msgid "Disable Bookmarks in all applications."
msgstr "Leestekens binnen all Programmen utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:7 kiosk_data.cpp:55
msgid "Disable all tasks and applications that require root access"
msgstr "All Opgaven un Programmen utmaken, de Systeemplegerverlöven bruukt"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:8
msgid "In multi-user environments the users normally do not know the root password; in such a case, it may be desirable to use this option to remove the tasks and applications from the menus that the users cannot use."
msgstr "In Mehrbruker-Ümgeven weet de Brukers dat Systeempleger-Passwoort normalerwies nich. Denn mag dat goot wesen, wenn Du disse Optschoon bruukst un de Opgaven un Programmen, de de Brukers so un so nich bruken köönt, ut de Menüs wegmaakst."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:9
msgid "Disable access to a command shell"
msgstr "Togriep op de Konsool utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:10
msgid "In an environment where the desktop is dedicated to a defined set of tasks it may be desirable to disable access to a command shell to prevent users from engaging in tasks that were not intended or authorized; hence, it is strongly recommended to disable access to a command shell if the desktop is to act as a public terminal."
msgstr "In en Ümgeven, binnen de de Schriefdisch bloots för en fast Sett vun Opgaven inricht is, mag dat goot wesen, wenn Du den Togriep op de Konsool utmaakst, denn köönt keen Brukers Saken doon, de se nich schöölt oder wo se keen Verlöven för hebbt. Lieksterwelt is dat redig anraadt, dat Du den Togriep op de Konsool utmaakst, wenn Du den Reekner as en apen Terminal bruken wullt."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:11
msgid "Disable Logout option"
msgstr "Afmellen utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:12
msgid "This prevents the user from logging out. To make this option effective it is important to ensure that key-combinations to terminate the X-server, such as Alt-Ctrl-Backspace, are disabled in the configuration of the X-server."
msgstr "Dit verhöödt, dat de Bruker sik afmellen deit. Wullt Du, dat disse Optschoon funkscheneert, muttst Du besekern, all Tastkombinatschonen för't Utmaken vun den X-Server (as Strg+Alt+Torüchtast) sünd binnen den X-Server sien Instellen utmaakt."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:13
msgid "Disable Lock Screen option"
msgstr "Afsluten vun den Schirm utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:14
msgid "When the desktop is to act as a public terminal or is to be shared by different users it may be desirable to prevent locking of the screen to ensure that the system remains accessible if a user leaves the terminal."
msgstr "Wullt Du den Reekner as apen Terminal inrichten oder schall mehr as een Bruker em bruken, mag dat goot wesen, Du maakst dat Afsluten vun den Schirm ut. Denn blifft de Reekner ok denn bruukbor, wenn en Bruker dat Terminal stahn lett."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:15
msgid "Disable \"Run Command\" option (Alt-F2)"
msgstr "\"Befehl utföhren\"-Dialoog (Alt+F2) utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:16
msgid "The \"Run Command\" option can normally be used to execute arbitrary commands; however, when access to a command shell is restricted only applications and services defined by a .desktop file can be started this way. Disabling \"Run Command\" here hides the option completely."
msgstr "De Dialoog \"Befehl utföhren\" lett sik normalerwies för't Utföhren vun all un een Befehl bruken; man wenn de Togriep op de Konsool ingrenzt is, laat sik bloots Programmen un Deensten opropen, de en .desktop-Datei hebbt. Hier kannst Du den Dialoog heel utmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:17
msgid "Disable toolbar moving"
msgstr "Verschuven vun Warktüüchbalkens utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:18
msgid "Normally toolbars in applications can be moved around; when this option is chosen \t all toolbars are fixed in their original positions."
msgstr "Normalerwies laat sik Warktüüchbalkens binnen Programmen bewegen. Is disse Optschoon anmaakt, sünd all Warktüüchbalkens an ehr Orginaalsteden fastsett."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:19
msgid "Disable execution of arbitrary .desktop files."
msgstr "Utföhren vun egenklook utsöcht .desktop-Dateien utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:20
msgid "This option defines whether users may execute .desktop files that are not part of the system-wide desktop icons, KDE menu, registered services or autostart services. When access to a command shell is restricted it is recommended to to disable the execution of arbitrary .desktop files as well since such .desktop files can be used to circumvent the command shell restriction."
msgstr "Disse Optschoon leggt fast, wat Brukers .desktop-Dateien utföhren dörvt, de nich Deel sünd vun de normalen Schriefdisch-Lüttbiller, dat KDE-Menü, vun inmeldt oder Sülvststart-Deensten. Is de Togriep op de Konsool ingrenzt, is dat anraadt, Du maakst ok dat Utföhren un egenköppsch utsöcht .desktop-Dateien ut - dor lett sik de Konsool-Ingrenzen mit torüchdreihen."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:21
msgid "Disable starting of a second X session."
msgstr "Starten vun en tweet X-Törn utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:22
msgid "KDM has the possibility to login a second user in parallel to the current session. Note that this can also be configured as part of the KDM settings in which case the setting here should be left enabled."
msgstr "Bi KDM kann Een sik as tweet Bruker blang den aktuellen Törn anmellen. Du kannst dat ok binnen de KDM-Instellen ännern, man denn laat disse Optschoon anmaakt."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:23
msgid "Disable input line history"
msgstr "Ingaavreeg-Vörgeschicht utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:24
msgid "If a single account is used by multiple people it may be desirable to disable the input line history out of privacy considerations."
msgstr "Bruukt mehr Brukers Is een enkel Ko, mag dat goot wesen, Du maakst de Ingaavreeg-Vörgeschicht ut. Dat schuult de Brukers ehr Privaatrebeet.to "

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:25
msgid "Enforce DRM restrictions"
msgstr "DVP-Ingrenzen verdwingen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:26
msgid "Some KDE applications can enforce DRM restrictions on content. You may want to enable this if your organisation relies on such restrictions or if local law requires it."
msgstr "En Reeg KDE-Programmen köönt Ingrenzen ut de Digitaal VerlööfnisPleeg (engl. »Digital Rights Management«, kort »DRM«) verdwingen. Maak dit an, wenn Dien Organisatschoon vun disse Ingrenzen afhangt oder dat Recht in Dien Land dat verlangen deit."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:27
msgid "Prevent Downloading"
msgstr "Daalladen verhöden"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:28
msgid "\t Some KDE applications can prevent the user from downloading or \t uploading files. The normal web browsing experience will not be \t affected. Note that you still have to set up the unix file permissions \t correctly - treat this as merely cosmetic for security. \t"
msgstr "En Reeg KDE-Programmen köönt dat verhöden, dat Brukers Dateien daal- oder hoochlaadt. Nettkieken is liekers normaal mööglich. Man beacht: Du muttst de UNIX-Dateiverlöven liekers akraat setten - dit hier is man bloots kosmeetsch för de Sekerheit."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:29
msgid "Desktop Icons"
msgstr "Schriefdischlüttbiller"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:30
msgid "Desktop Icons are provided by \"kdesktop\"."
msgstr "Schriefdischlüttbiller warrt vun \"kdesktop\" praatstellt."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:31
msgid "Lock down Desktop Settings"
msgstr "Schriefdisch-Instellen fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:32
msgid "When the desktop settings are locked down the user can no longer change how the desktop behaves or look like. This does not affect the ability to add new files or shortcuts to the desktop."
msgstr "Sünd de Instellen vun den Schriefdisch fastsett, köönt Brukers nich mehr topassen, wodennig he utsüht oder sik bedregen deit. Lüttbiller un Dateien laat sik ok wieder tofögen."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:33
msgid "Disable context menus"
msgstr "Rechtsklickmenüs utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:34
msgid "When checked the user will no longer get any context menu. Normally the user can get a context menu by clicking with the right mouse button."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, köönt de Brukers keen Rechtklickmenüs opropen. Normalerwies köönt se dat mit den rechten Muusknoop."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:35
msgid "Lock down all Desktop icons"
msgstr "All Schriefdisch-Lüttbiller fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:36
msgid "When checked the user will not be able to remove or edit any existing icon or file on the Desktop or add any new icon or file."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, köönt Brukers keen vörhannen Lüttbiller oder Dateien op den Schriefdisch bewerken oder wegmaken, un ok keen nieg Lüttbiller oder Dateien tofögen."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:37
msgid "Lock down system wide Desktop icons"
msgstr "Systeem-Schriefdischlüttbiller fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:38
msgid "When checked the user will not be able to remove or edit any of the system wide icons but will still be able to add, remove or edit personal icons or files on the desktop."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, köönt Brukers keen Systeem-Lüttbiller bewerken oder wegmaken, man köönt egen Lüttbiller un Dateien ok wieder tofögen, bewerken un wegmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:39
msgid "Add additional vendor specific icons"
msgstr "Bito Maker-Lüttbiller tofögen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:40
msgid "When this option is checked users will get additional icons copied to their Desktop when they first log in. These icons do not appear in the preview."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, hebbt Brukers bi't eerste Anmellen noch anner Lüttbiller op ehr Schriefdischen. Disse Lüttbiller dukt in de Vöransicht nich op."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:41
msgid "Desktop Background"
msgstr "Schriefdisch-Achtergrund"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:42
msgid "Set up the Desktop Background also known as Wallpaper."
msgstr "Den Schriefdisch Achtergrund, ok Achtergrundbild nöömt, inrichten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:43
msgid "Lock down Desktop Background Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för den Schriefdisch-Achtergrund fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:44
msgid "When the desktop background settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Achtergrundinstellen vun den Schriefdisch fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:45
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Pausschirm"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:46
msgid "Set up Screen Saver"
msgstr "Pausschirm instellen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:47
msgid "Lock down Screen Saver Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för den Pausschirm fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:48
msgid "When the Screen Saver settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Pausschirminstellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:49
msgid "Disable OpenGL-based Screen Savers"
msgstr "OpenGL-Pausschirmen utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:50
msgid "OpenGL-based screen savers may cause problems on systems without decent OpenGL support; with this option all such screensavers can be disabled."
msgstr "Pausschirmen, de OpenGL bruukt, köönt op Reekners, de keen dannig OpenGL-Ünnerstütten hebbt, to Problemen föhren. Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du all disse Pausschirmen utmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:51
msgid "Discreet Screen Savers Only"
msgstr "Bloots schulen Pausschirmen bruken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:52
msgid "Some screensavers do not hide the complete screen content and may leave possible sensitive information visible. This option disables all such screensavers and only enables those screensavers that completely hide the original content of the screen."
msgstr "En Reeg Pausschirmen versteekt nich den helen Schirminholt, se laat Saken sichtbor, de villicht schuulsam sünd. Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du all disse Pausschirmen ut- un bloots de anmaken, de den Schirm sien Orginaalinholt heel un deel versteken doot."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:53
msgid "KDE Menu"
msgstr "KDE-Menü"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:54
msgid "The KDE Application menu"
msgstr "Dat KDE-Programmmenü"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:56
msgid "This option disables all menu items that require root access and that will ask the user for the root password."
msgstr "Disse Optschoon maakt all Menüindrääg ut, de Systeemplegerverlöven bruukt un den Bruker na den Systeempleger sien Passwoort fraagt."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:57
msgid "Disable menu editing"
msgstr "Menübewerken utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:58
msgid "This disables the menu-option to edit the KDE Application Menu. When disabled, users will no longer be able to make changes to their personal application menu."
msgstr "Dit maakt de Menüoptschoon ut, mit de sik dat KDE-Menü bewerken lett. Is dat utmaakt, köönt Brukers ehr egen Programmmenü nich mehr topassen."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:59
msgid "Theming"
msgstr "Mustern"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:60
msgid "Set up of Fonts, Colors and Style"
msgstr "Schriftoorden, Klören un Stil fastleggen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:61
msgid "Lock down Style Settings"
msgstr "Stil-Instellen fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:62
msgid "When the Style settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Stil-Instellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:63
msgid "Lock down Color Settings"
msgstr "Klöörinstellen fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:64
msgid "When the Color settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Klöörinstellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:65
msgid "Lock down Font Settings"
msgstr "Schriftoort-Instellen fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:66
msgid "When the Font settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Schriftoort-Instellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:67
msgid "Lock down Window Decoration Settings"
msgstr "Finsterdekoratschoon-Instellen fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:68
msgid "When the Window Decoration settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Instellen för de Finsterdekoratschoon fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:69
msgid "Panel"
msgstr "Paneel"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:70
msgid "The KDE panel \"kicker\" is normally found at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "Normalerwies is dat KDE-Paneel \"kicker\" nerrn op den Schirm"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:71
msgid "Lock down panel"
msgstr "Paneel fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:72
msgid "This option can be used to lock down the panel. The user will then no longer be able to add, remove or change any of the permanent panel items."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du dat Paneel fastsetten, Brukers köönt denn keen duerhaftig Paneelelementen mehr tofögen, ännern oder wegmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:73
msgid "Disable Context Menus"
msgstr "Rechtsklickmenüs utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:74
msgid "This option disables the context menus that one normally gets when pressing the right mouse button in the panel."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Rechtsklickmenüs utmaken, de Een normalerwies mit den rechten Muusknoop in't Paneel opropen kann."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:75
msgid "Network Proxy"
msgstr "Nettwark-Proxy"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:76
msgid "Set up of Network Proxy settings"
msgstr "Instellen för den Nettwark-Proxy"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:77
msgid "Lock down Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Proxy-Instellen fastsetten"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:78
msgid "When the Proxy settings are locked down the user can no longer change them."
msgstr "Sünd de Proxy-Instellen fastsett, köönt Brukers se nich mehr ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:79
msgid "Konqueror"
msgstr "Konqueror"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:80
msgid "Konqueror is a combined web- and filebrowser."
msgstr "Konqueror is Nettkieker un Dateipleger in een Programm."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:81
msgid "Disable Properties in context menu"
msgstr "\"Egenschappen\" binnen Rechtsklickmenü utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:82
msgid "This option can be used to disable the <i>Properties</i> option in the context menu for files."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de Optschoon <i>Egenschappen</i> binnen dat Rechtsklickmenü vun Dateien utmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:83
msgid "Disable Open With action"
msgstr "\"Opmaken mit\" utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:84
msgid "This option can be used to disable the <i>Open With</i> menu option."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de <i>Opmaken mit</i>-Menüoptschoon utmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:85
msgid "Disable Open In New Tab action"
msgstr "\"In'n nieg Paneel opmaken\" utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:86
msgid "This option can be used to disable the <i>Open In New Tab</i> menu option."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du de <i>In'n nieg Paneel opmaken</i>-Menüoptschoon utmaken."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:87
msgid "Disable file-browsing outside home directory"
msgstr "Keen Dateien buten den Tohuusorner ankieken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:88
msgid "This option can be used to prevent the user from browsing the file system outside his or her own home directory."
msgstr "Mit disse Optschoon kannst Du verhöden, dat Brukers sik Dateien buten ehr egen Tohuusornern ankiekt."

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:89
msgid "Menu Actions"
msgstr "Menü-Akschonen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:90
msgid "Common menu actions found in applications."
msgstr "Allmeen Menüakschonen binnen Programmen"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:91 kiosk_data.cpp:93 kiosk_data.cpp:95 kiosk_data.cpp:97
#: kiosk_data.cpp:99 kiosk_data.cpp:101 kiosk_data.cpp:103 kiosk_data.cpp:105
#: kiosk_data.cpp:107 kiosk_data.cpp:109 kiosk_data.cpp:111
#, c-format
msgid "Disable File -> %action"
msgstr "\"Datei -> %action\" utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: kiosk_data.cpp:92 kiosk_data.cpp:96 kiosk_data.cpp:98 kiosk_data.cpp:100
#: kiosk_data.cpp:102 kiosk_data.cpp:104 kiosk_data.cpp:108 kiosk_data.cpp:110
#, c-format
msgid "This option can be used to remove the <i>File -> %action</i> menu-option from all applications."
